+
+#### Durable reservation custody
+
+The capability harness uses the fixed permanent data branch
+`codex/browserstack-lifetime-ledger` in `mxbaylee/spinel`, with one file,
+`browserstack-lifetime-ledger.json`. This is operational accounting state and is
+explicitly excluded from obsolete-ticket branch cleanup. Data updates do not
+match the general CI workflow's `push.branches: [main]` trigger. Initialization
+is a separate explicit operation from the owner-attested seed; a missing or
+corrupt file must never be interpreted as unused credit or recreated silently.
+No branch has been created at this source checkpoint.
+
+The source adapter uses the GitHub Contents API's existing blob SHA as a compare
+and swap precondition. It admits at most a 1 MiB ledger and 2 MiB API envelope,
+four requests and 30 seconds per operation, with eight seconds per request.
+Before creating a device session it records the run/attempt, source/tested SHAs,
+a fresh invocation identity, the elapsed-time budget and timestamp. An existing
+reservation prevents reallocation. A lost write response is read back against
+the same proposed blob and invocation identity; a conflict or unproved durable
+write never permits a device POST. Publication is never retried blindly.
+
+Session identity and cleanup uncertainty remain in that same reservation. They
+cannot be cleared because a process exited or a later retained-history page
+omitted the session. The first source adapter deliberately does not implement
+settlement; reconciliation against verified terminal usage is a separate required
+step before any later automatic allocation. The stored elapsed budget is not a
+certified billing ceiling. Repository concurrency coordinates this repository
+only; unknown activity from other projects remains outside that lock.
+
+Only trusted manual/scheduled source may receive a least-privilege token with
+`contents: write` for this operation. PR code does not receive a write token.
+The source adapter cannot select another repository, branch, path or returned
+download URL. All remote errors are reduced to fixed local categories. Source
+and tests are in progress; no provider allocation, publication or dispatch is
+claimed by this custody design.
+
+#### Bounded capability control source and preview boundary
+
+The first control implementation admits one session only after the exact durable
+reservation is read back. It permits 80 action-command attempts, an eight-second
+command bound, a 64 KiB request/response limit, and at most four candidate webview
+contexts. Creation has a 45-second bound. No action starts unless its full bound
+fits before 135 seconds from creation dispatch; independent cleanup lasts only
+until 180 seconds. Seven cleanup requests include two reserved for session
+deletion and terminal measurement. Network restoration additionally requires
+the owned fixture's reachability check before it can be reported as observed.
+Lost creation identity and unconfirmed deletion retain the reservation; there is
+no replacement session. These are local execution limits, not a certified
+provider charging ceiling or proof that a remote session ended.
+
+The core intentionally has no dispatch entry point yet. Trusted production
+preview, genuine authentication and content/offline checks must be supplied by
+owned code; missing authentication stops with `capability-incomplete`. Mock
+transport callbacks in unit tests are not physical-device or passkey evidence.
+The checked source passes [25 deterministic tests, scoped strict compilation and
+lint](SPN-090-capability-validation.json). That record also preserves the earlier
+fixture run-URL failures, Buffer fixture typing failure and cleanup lint failure.
+No provider, tunnel, branch initialization or paid feature was used.
+
+The next launcher will own one disposable child application and one pinned
+`cloudflared` process. It will seed only synthetic users/content before exposure,
+choose one Quick Tunnel hostname, and bind that exact HTTPS origin to the app's
+real WebAuthn verifier. Before reservation, normal certificate verification must
+authenticate the origin; HTML, manifest, icons, worker/assets and an actual
+WebSocket upgrade must match the owned build and child. A process or tunnel
+restart invalidates this preflight rather than silently changing origin. Cleanup
+must observe both owned processes exit before deleting their private directory;
+uncertain closure retains the fixture. The public endpoint is temporary test
+data, not the SPN-038 production domain. Cloudflare's [Quick Tunnel limits](https://developers.cloudflare.com/tunnel/get-started/quick-tunnels/)
+and lack of a reliability guarantee remain explicit; a preflight failure spends
+no device allowance.
+
+SPN-052 on main `416cf214` supplies real desktop profile/native-input evidence
+and reusable Doc/Sheet/image snapshots. Its desktop fixture deliberately seeds
+sessions, so that login helper cannot establish SPN-090's installed-device
+authentication. Reuse its content and comparison helpers; use a one-use
+production invite/recovery ceremony in the installed webview for this probe,
+then check the server-verified account. Do not inject a cookie or override
+`navigator.credentials`. BrowserStack's [documented native permission contexts](https://www.browserstack.com/docs/automate/selenium/handle-permission-pop-ups)
+justify probing native controls, not assuming home-screen automation works.
+Its [documented passkey setup](https://www.browserstack.com/docs/live/device-settings/webauth-device-passcode)
+is an Android Live Pro feature, not evidence of this free Automate iPhone
+capability. Unsupported native/passkey controls remain a concrete capability
+blocker, with no paid upgrade or fabricated authentication fallback.
+
+This preserves the Owner's finite allowance and honest launch expectations,
+the Collaborator's actual account/content boundary, the Link guest's exclusion
+from durable private downloads, and the Operator's visible failures and
+recoverable evidence. Monthly scheduling,
+reservation settlement, complete-matrix cost and all physical acceptance remain
+required; this local control checkpoint does not complete them.
